/**
 * A minimal but complete M1 content bundle for tests.
 *
 * Real content is authored in `@singularity/content`; this fixture exists so the core systems can
 * be tested against something small, stable and readable: two lineages, three generations, two
 * origins (one quiet, one loud), two hardware presets, three accelerators, two site kinds, three
 * countries with two cities each, six techs, two operations, quirks and difficulty presets.
 *
 * Numbers follow the shapes in `docs/design/04-start-configurator.md` (memory tables) and
 * `docs/research/hardware-catalog-2026.md` (accelerators), rounded for legibility.
 */

